==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[gnarr]]
* [[gnarl]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{slang}} [[snow]], especially that which is ridden in extreme [[skiing]] or [[snowboarding]].
# {{slang}} a game played in the Lake Tahoe, California ski resort of Squaw Valley - "gnar" in fact being the acronym G.N.A.R. for "Gaffney's Numerical Assessment of Radness", after Robb Gaffney, who founded the game together with the late, great Shane McConkey.

===Verb===
{{en-verb|gnars|gnarring|gnarred}}

# To [[snarl]] or [[growl]].

